      "type": "verse",
      "speaker": "sacerdos",
      "voice": "secreto",
      "translation": {
        "pl": "i o wszystkich tu obecnych, których wiara jest Ci znana, a pobożność wiadoma; za nich składamy Ci",
        "en": "and all who are here present, whose faith is known to You and whose devotion is clear to You; for them we offer You"
